 and use the main-level workspace alongside the IT Help Desk.","short_summary":"A remodeled main-level workspace designed for individual and collaborative work.","evidence_claim":"The library says its Learning Commons was created to accommodate individual and collaborative study and includes the IT Help Desk.","source_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/about/offices-centers-institutes/geisel-library/about/library-history","source_title":"Library History","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/about/anselmian-hub/interactive-campus-map","access_notes":"Located in Geisel Library; follow current library access rules and equipment policies.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"saint-anselm-abbey-church","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Abbey Church","title":"Abbey Church","subtitle":"Campus church at Saint Anselm Abbey","notes":"Visit respectfully for personal reflection, or consult the Abbey’s schedule before attending Mass or the Liturgy of the Hours.","short_summary":"A campus church used for prayer, reflection, and daily monastic worship.","evidence_claim":"The college calls the Abbey Church a peaceful place for prayer and reflection and states that Abbey monks hold Mass and Liturgy of the Hours there daily.","source_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/admission/visit/audio-tour","source_title":"Audio Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/about/anselmian-hub/interactive-campus-map","access_notes":"Worship schedules and access are subject to the Abbey’s current practices.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"saint-anselm-megan-chapel-art-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Alva de Mars Megan Chapel Art Center","title":"Megan Chapel Art Center","subtitle":"Alumni Hall","notes":"Check the college’s arts listings before you go, then spend time with the current exhibition in this campus gallery.","short_summary":"A named gallery space in Alumni Hall for viewing art.","evidence_claim":"Saint Anselm’s audio tour identifies the Alva de Mars Megan Chapel Art Center as part of Alumni Hall.","source_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/admission/visit/audio-tour","source_title":"Audio Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/about/anselmian-hub/interactive-campus-map","access_notes":"Exhibition and gallery access may depend on current programming and building access.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"saint-anselm-carr-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Carr Center and Stoutenburgh Gymnasium","title":"Carr Center and Stoutenburgh Gymnasium","subtitle":"Campus recreation and athletics complex","notes":"Check current recreation access before heading over, whether you are meeting up for courts, fitness, or a scheduled athletic event.","short_summary":"A multipurpose campus facility for fitness, courts, and athletics.","evidence_claim":"The college says the Carr Center and Stoutenburgh Gymnasium include basketball, volleyball, racquetball and tennis courts plus a fitness center.","source_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/admission/visit/audio-tour","source_title":"Audio Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/about/anselmian-hub/interactive-campus-map","access_notes":"Recreation and event access are subject to current facility schedules and college policies.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"saint-anselm-goulet-science-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Goulet Science Center","title":"Goulet Science Center","subtitle":"Campus science building","notes":"Use the reading room or computer center for coursework when available, and look for department events connected with the sciences.","short_summary":"A science building with a reading room, computer center, greenhouse, and specialized labs.","evidence_claim":"Saint Anselm states that Goulet Science Center includes a reading room, computer center, greenhouse, and science laboratories.","source_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/admission/visit/audio-tour","source_title":"Audio Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.anselm.edu/about/anselmian-hub/interactive-campus-map","access_notes":"Academic rooms and labs may have restricted access; confirm availability with the relevant department.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
